OL,3,GNEWSAHealth secretary to meet maternity
OL,4,Afamilies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved dad says the health
OL,7,Fsecretary has agreed to meet with
OL,8,Ffamilies affected by maternity failings
OL,9,Fin Nottingham.
OL,11,FWhen Yvette Cooper was appointed as
OL,12,Fhealth secretary in July, bereaved and
OL,13,Fharmed families wrote to her asking her
OL,14,Fat the time for a meeting "at your
OL,15,Fearliest convenience".
OL,17,FGary Andrews, dad to Wynter, who died
OL,18,Fafter failings at Nottingham University
OL,19,FHospitals, said he spoke to Cooper at a
OL,20,Fmaternity meeting in London on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
