OL,3,GNEWSAHealth secretary to meet maternity
OL,4,Afamilies
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has said she agreed to come to
OL,7,FNottingham and speak to families, some
OL,8,Fof whom are calling for a statutory
OL,9,Fpublic inquiry into maternity care.
